  "description": "This is a superb own door apartment, offering excellent, well-proportioned accommodation over one level, is well presented throughout. \nIt is close to all  amenities and within walking distance of UHL and Raheen Business Park. Overlooking a green to the front and with ample communal parking outside the apartment, the setting could not be better.\n On entering the hall door you are met with a spacious hallway which accesses all rooms. To the left is a door to the kitchen which is fully fitted and runs into the spacious living room, which has a dual aspect giving plenty of natural light to the room. There are two bedrooms, with the main bedroom having an ensuite shower room and a separate family bathroom completing the accommodation. \nGreenview Court, Glencairn is an idyllic suburban development set within minutes of Dooradoyle, Crescent Shopping Centre, University Hospital Limerick and Raheen Business Park. The area benefits from a superb selection of residential amenities, including childcare services, a selection of high end gym & sporting facilities, shops, restaurants, and primary & secondary schools. Both St Pauls & St Nessans National Schools are within walking distance, as is the highly regarded Crescent Comprehensive College. \nEntrance Hall with front door, tiled floor, hotpress and storage cupboard\n Kitchen with part tiled walls, range of wall and floor level kitchen units, drawers and work surfaces, sink and drainer, integrated electric oven and hob, extractor/cooker hood, plumbed for washing machine/dishwasher, tiled floor\n Living Room with feature bay window and wood flooring\n Bedroom 1 double bedroom with range of fitted wardrobes En-Suite with tiled shower, cubicle, WC, pedestal, WHB, tiled floor, extractor unit\n Bedroom 2 double bedroom with fitted wardrobe and wood flooring Bathroom with part tiled walls, panelled bath, WC, pedestal WHB, tiled floor and extractor unit.\n\n\n\nProperty Features\n•\tTwo double bedroom apartment\n•\tGarden level\n•\tSpacious interiors\n•\tAmple communal parking\n•\tEnsuite and bathroom\n•      17 minute walk to Raheen Business park\n•      30 minute walk to University Hospital Limerick",
